## MCP Client Setup (Codex + Cursor)

- **Endpoints**: Codex uses streamable-HTTP `POST /`, Cursor uses SSE `GET /sse` + `POST /messages`.
- **Remote host**: Local SSH tunnels are not visible to agents. Use `cloudflared tunnel --url http://localhost:8765` to expose a public URL.
- **Codex config**:
  ```toml
  [mcp_servers.star-suite]
  type = "streamable-http"
  url = "https://your-public-url"
  ```
- **Cursor config**:
  ```toml
  [mcp_servers.star-suite]
  type = "sse"
  url = "https://your-public-url/sse"
  ```
